            "title": "Sonida in Merger Talks to Create One of America\u2019s Largest Senior Housing Firms",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Sonida Senior Living  is in advanced talks to acquire a smaller rival in a $1.8 billion deal that would create one of the country\u2019s largest senior housing companies.  The senior housing business is emerging as one of the hottest in the commercial real-estate sector, recovering from a devastating slump that lasted for years.  A glut of new supply and collapse in demand during the pandemic caused occupancy rates to tumble and many senior housing facilities to shut down.",
